<title>ITALY: Stet sell-off set for 1997 - Italy Tresaury.</title>
<headline>Stet sell-off set for 1997 - Italy Tresaury.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The privatisation of telecoms holding Stet will go ahead in 1997 even if the sale does not take place by the end of next March, as currently planned, the Italian Treasury said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It added that it would do everything possible to protect the asset base of Stet's parent -- state holding IRI.</p>
</text>
